OL,3,AANC under pressure to reverse South
OL,4,AAfrica decline
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Africans are voting in highly
OL,7,Fcontested local elections likely to see
OL,8,Fa haemorrhaging of votes for the
OL,9,Fcountry's biggest party, the African
OL,10,FNational Congress (ANC).
OL,12,FThis year's voting season has been
OL,13,Fmarked by intense campaigns that have
OL,14,Fincluded politicians spinning cars,
OL,15,Fwatching grannies knit and even wading
OL,16,Fthrough giant-sized potholes.
OL,18,FElection officials say voting is going
OL,19,Fsmoothly, despite long queues at some
OL,20,Fpolling stations.
