OL,4,AAfrica decline
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders are campaigning to head South
OL,7,FAfrica's nearly 300 municipalities,
OL,8,Fresponsible for basic service provision
OL,9,Fsuch as water, electricity and refuse
OL,10,Fcollection.
